[02:05.42]
[02:21.70][Rap – Smooth, controlled flow]
[02:22.60]Hands on the wheel, red lights carved in chrome
[02:23.97]Wolf in a dress shirt, pulse buried under snow
[02:25.54]They call it a life, but I hear the old drum
[02:27.49]Haltu veiðinni áfram — I was never far from
[02:29.09]Chain on my name, but the blood won’t sit still
[02:30.86]Forfeður kalla from the dark of the hill
[02:32.72]Undir húðinni, something starts breathing
[02:34.03]Ég er dýrið — now the silence has meaning
[02:35.91]Hjartað slær eins og hamar — hit-hit, harder
[02:38.09]Ice in the marrow, fire in the armor
[02:39.96]Clock in, boxed in, lungs getting smaller
[02:41.75]Haltu veiðinni áfram — the old gods holler
[02:43.16]Ég er dýrið, can you feel it? Can you hear it?
[02:44.21]No more mirror, no more mask, no more spirit to bury
[02:45.69]Beneath it, I breathe it, I bleed it, I steer it
[02:47.27]Ég er dýrið! Ég er dýrið! Don’t fear it!
[02:48.73]
[02:49.88]One slow breath — I don’t run, I don’t kneel
[02:52.73]Ég er dýrið — I can feel their fear
[02:54.29]The beast is awake, but I hold the steel
[02:56.26]Haltu veiðinni áfram —
[02:58.95]I’ve always been real
